<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Authly SSO — Frontend Integratsiya Qo'llanmasi</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f2937; margin: 40px; }
  h1 { color: #1e40af; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 8px; }
  h2 { color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 6px; }
  h3 { color: #2563eb; margin-top: 20px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #111827; font-weight: 600; }
  pre { background-color: #1e1e2e; color: #cdd6f4; padding: 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-x: auto; }
  code { font-family: Consolas, monospace; background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: #dc2626; font-size: 13px; }
  pre code { background: none; color: inherit; padding: 0; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .badge-danger { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .alert-box { background-color: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 18px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
  .alert-danger { background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 18px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Authly SSO — Mijoz (Frontend) Integratsiya Qo'llanmasi</h1>
  <p><strong>Veb-saytlar, SPA va zamonaviy frontend freymvorklar (React, Next.js, Vue, Nuxt) dasturchilari uchun yagona kirish (SSO) integratsiyasi bo'yicha rasmiy texnik spetsifikatsiya.</strong></p>

  <table>
    <tr><th>Hujjat turi</th><td>Frontend integratsiya spetsifikatsiyasi va UI qo'llanmasi</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Protokol</th><td>OAuth 2.0 (Authorization Code Flow Client)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Versiya</th><td>1.0.0 (Rasmiy nashr)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Oxirgi yangilanish</th><td>2026-yil noyabr</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Authly Web manzili</th><td>https://authly.uz</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Tavsiya etilgan freymvorklar</th><td>React, Next.js 14+, Vue 3, Nuxt 3</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>1. Kirish va Frontend Vazifalari</h2>
  <p>Authly SSO — veb-saytingiz foydalanuvchilariga qayta ro'yxatdan o'tmasdan, mavjud Authly akkaunti (Telegram, Google, SMS) orqali tizimingizga bir bosish bilan xavfsiz kirish imkonini beradi.</p>
  <p>OAuth 2.0 protokoli doirasida Frontend (mijoz) qismi faqat foydalanuvchi interfeysini taqdim etish va yo'naltirishlar (redirection) bilan shug'ullanadi. Xavfsizlik nuqtai nazaridan tokenlar almashinuvi va maxfiy kalitlar bilan ishlash backend server zimmasiga yuklatiladi.</p>

  <div class="alert-danger">
    <strong>MUHIM XAVFSIZLIK QOIDASI:</strong> Frontend ilovalarda (React, Next.js, Vue) hech qachon <code>AUTHLY_CLIENT_SECRET</code> maxfiy kalitini ishlatmang va saqlamang. Agar client_secret frontendga chiqarilsa, ilovangiz xavfsizligi butunlay buziladi.
  </div>

  <h2>2. Muhit Parametrlari (Frontend .env)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>O'zgaruvchi (Vite / React)</th><th>O'zgaruvchi (Next.js)</th><th>Namuna Qiymat</th><th>Vazifasi</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>VITE_AUTHLY_FRONTEND_URL</code></td><td><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTHLY_FRONTEND_URL</code></td><td>https://authly.uz</td><td>Authly veb interfeysi manzili.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>VITE_AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID</code></td><td><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID</code></td><td>c4a7e91b82d3f...</td><td>Ilovangizning ochiq identifikatori.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>VITE_AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI</code></td><td><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI</code></td><td>https://saytingiz.uz/auth/callback</td><td>Frontend callback manzili.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>VITE_BACKEND_API_URL</code></td><td><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_API_URL</code></td><td>https://api.saytingiz.uz</td><td>O'z backend serveringiz API manzili.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>3. 1-bosqich: Login Havolasini Shakllantirish</h2>
  <h3>1-strategiya: Havolani Backenddan Olish (Tavsiya Etiladi)</h3>
  <pre><code>// Foydalanuvchi 'Kirish' tugmasini bosganda
const handleLoginWithAuthly = async () => {
  try {
    const res = await axios.get(`${BACKEND_API_URL}/api/v1/auth/authly/url/`);
    window.location.href = res.data.url;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error("Login havolasini olishda xatolik:", error);
  }
};</code></pre>

  <h3>2-strategiya: Havolani To'g'ridan-to'g'ri Frontendda Yasash</h3>
  <pre><code>const handleDirectLogin = () => {
  const authlyLoginUrl = new URL("https://authly.uz/login");
  authlyLoginUrl.searchParams.set("client_id", AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID);
  authlyLoginUrl.searchParams.set("redirect_uri", AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI);
  authlyLoginUrl.searchParams.set("response_type", "code");
  authlyLoginUrl.searchParams.set("scope", "read");
  window.location.href = authlyLoginUrl.toString();
};</code></pre>

  <h2>4. 2-bosqich: Callback Sahifasi va Kodni Qayta Ishlash</h2>
  <div class="alert-box">
    <strong>DIQQAT:</strong> <code>code</code> parametri faqat bir martalik va 120 soniya davomida amal qiladi. Sahifa yangilanganda qayta so'rov yuborilmasligi uchun kod yuborilishini bloklang.
  </div>

  <h2>5. 3-bosqich: 'Authly orqali kirish' Tugmasi Standartlari</h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;!-- HTML &amp; CSS Tugmasi --&gt;
&lt;button class="authly-login-btn" onclick="handleAuthlyLogin()"&gt;
  &lt;svg class="authly-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"&gt;
    &lt;path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/&gt;
  &lt;/svg&gt;
  &lt;span&gt;Authly orqali kirish&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;

&lt;style&gt;
.authly-login-btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
  width: 100%; max-width: 320px; padding: 12px 20px;
  background-color: #2563EB; color: #ffffff; border: none; border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
}
.authly-login-btn:hover { background-color: #1D4ED8; }
.authly-login-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
.authly-icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
&lt;/style&gt;</code></pre>

  <h2>6. Amaliy Frontend Freymvork Namunalari</h2>
  <h3>React.js (React Router v6 + Axios)</h3>
  <pre><code>// src/pages/AuthlyCallback.jsx
import React, { useEffect, useState, useRef } from "react";
import { useNavigate, useSearchParams } from "react-router-dom";
import axios from "axios";

export const AuthlyCallback = () => {
  const [searchParams] = useSearchParams();
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const [errorMessage, setErrorMessage] = useState(null);
  const requestSentRef = useRef(false);

  useEffect(() => {
    const code = searchParams.get("code");
    const error = searchParams.get("error");
    if (error) {
      setErrorMessage("Avtorizatsiya bekor qilindi yoki xatolik yuz berdi.");
      return;
    }
    if (!code) {
      setErrorMessage("Avtorizatsiya kodi (code) topilmadi.");
      return;
    }
    if (requestSentRef.current) return;
    requestSentRef.current = true;

    axios.post(`${process.env.REACT_APP_BACKEND_API_URL}/api/v1/auth/authly/callback/`, { code })
      .then((response) => {
        const { access_token, user } = response.data;
        localStorage.setItem("access_token", access_token);
        localStorage.setItem("user_profile", JSON.stringify(user));
        navigate("/dashboard", { replace: true });
      })
      .catch((err) => {
        setErrorMessage(err.response?.data?.detail || "Kirish jarayonida xatolik yuz berdi.");
      });
  }, [searchParams, navigate]);

  if (errorMessage) {
    return (
      &lt;div style={{ textAlign: "center", padding: "60px 20px" }}&gt;
        &lt;h2 style={{ color: "#DC2626" }}&gt;Xatolik yuz berdi&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;{errorMessage}&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;button onClick={() => navigate("/login")}&gt;Login sahifasiga qaytish&lt;/button&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    );
  }
  return &lt;div style={{ textAlign: "center", padding: "80px 20px" }}&gt;Authly bilan tasdiqlanmoqda...&lt;/div&gt;;
};</code></pre>
</body>
</html>